  <text>
    <body>
      <p>Robert F. Parker is listed as the proprietor of the <ref target="civic?id=Commercial%20hotel">Commercial Hotel</ref> on the corner of Bouverie and Queensberry streets in the 1905 directory.</p>
      <p>He is on the 1905 electoral roll as Robert Frederick Parker, 89 Bouverie Street, a victualler. The directory lists the hotel between Nos 87 and 93 Bouverie Street.</p>
      <p>See also <ref target="civic?id=Commercial%20hotel">Commercial Hotel</ref> and <ref target="civic?id=Hotels">Hotels</ref>.</p>
    </body>
